      "note": "Xitsonga ordinal hours ('awara yo sungula', 'awara ya vumbirhi' …), 'na hafu' / 'na kotara', minutes additive 'na timinete ta <n>'. Doubts: class-6 concord on tens (I wrote 'makume mambirhi/manharhu' but bare 'makume mune/ntlhanu' for 40/50, which is how I recall Tsonga treating 4 and 5); '11' as 'khume n'we'. No 'to' phrases."
